! TRACE.DBG - tracepoints (docs/PHASE-42.md, subtask 1): every
! instruction up to a break, a routine through its recursion, a JSB
! subroutine, every line and branch, and how SET, SHOW, and CANCEL TRACE
! word things.
!
SHOW TRACE
!
! Every instruction, up to FACT.
SET TRACE/INSTRUCTION
SET BREAK FACT
SHOW TRACE
GO
CANCEL TRACE/INSTRUCTION
CANCEL BREAK FACT
!
! FACT at each recursion, and the JSB subroutine, up to the loop.
SET TRACE FACT
SET TRACE BUMP
SET BREAK LOOP
SHOW TRACE
GO
CANCEL TRACE FACT
SHOW TRACE
CANCEL BREAK LOOP
!
! Every line and every branch, up to BUMP.
SET TRACE/LINE
SET TRACE/BRANCH
SET BREAK BUMP
SHOW TRACE
GO
CANCEL TRACE/ALL
SHOW TRACE
CANCEL BREAK/ALL
GO
